        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu aliniambia hivi: “Chukua ubao mkubwa, uandike juu yake maneno yanayosomeka kwa urahisi: ‘TEKA-HARAKA-POKONYA-UPESI.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Teka-haraka-pokonya-upesi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania: Maher-shalal-hash-bazi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, nikajipatia mashahidi wawili waaminifu ambao wangenishuhudia: Kuhani Uria na Zekaria, mwana wa Yeberekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nililala na mke wangu ambaye pia ni nabii, akapata mimba, akajifungua mtoto wa kiume. Mwenyezi-Mungu akaniambia, “Mpe mtoto huyo jina ‘Teka-haraka-pokonya-upesi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana kabla mtoto huyu hajafikia umri wa kuweza kutamka: ‘Baba’ au ‘Mama,’ utajiri wa Damasko na nyara walizoteka huko Samaria zitapelekwa kwa mfalme wa Ashuru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu aliongea nami tena, akaniambia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa kuwa watu hawa wameyakataa maji ya Shiloa yatiririkayo polepole, wakafa moyo mbele ya mfalme Resini na mfalme Peka mwana wa Remalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, mimi Bwana nitawaletea mafuriko makuu ya maji ya mto Eufrate yaani mfalme wa Ashuru na nguvu zake zote; yatafurika na kupita kingo zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utaingia nchini Yuda kwa nguvu na kufurika na kupanda mpaka shingoni; utaenea juu ya nchi yako yote, ee Emanueli!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alinionya kwa nguvu nisifuate njia za watu hawa, akaniambia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:12-13 Taz 1Pet 3:14-15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Usijumuike nao katika njama zao, wala usiogope yale wanayoyaogopa wala kuwa na hofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitambue mimi peke yangu, Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, kuwa mtakatifu; utaniogopa na kunicha mimi peke yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:14-15 Taz 1Pet 2:8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mimi nitakuwa kimbilio, nitakuwa pia kama jiwe la kujikwaa, mwamba wa kuziangusha falme za Israeli na Yuda; nitakuwa mtego wa kuwatega na kuwanasa wakazi wa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wengi watajikwaa, wataanguka na kupondeka; watanaswa katika mtego huo na kuchukuliwa mateka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitalihifadhi agizo hilo na kulifunga fundisho hilo miongoni mwa wafuasi wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:17 Taz Ebr 2:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nitamngojea Mwenyezi-Mungu ambaye amejificha mbali na wazawa wa Yakobo; nitamtumainia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:18 Taz Ebr 2:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mimi pamoja na watoto alionipa Mwenyezi-Mungu ni ishara na alama katika Israeli kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi akaaye mlimani Siyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhi watawaambieni: “Nendeni mkatake shauri kwa mizimu na mizuka iliayo kama ndege; kwani ni kawaida watu kutaka shauri kwa miungu yao, na kutaka shauri kwa wafu kwa ajili ya walio hai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakika anayesema hivyo hajapata kuona mwanga. Lakini nyinyi shikilieni lile agizo na fundisho la Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
